		<div class="hidden udot-notice banner notice-info" data-noticeid="72426" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="notice-72426-heading"><div class="banner-header"><h4 id="notice-72426-heading"><a href="https://connect.udot.utah.gov/notices/scam-alert-utah-toll-services/">SCAM ALERT: Multiple fraudulent texts and calls claiming unpaid tolls, tickets, or other infractions &#8211; NOT FROM UDOT OR DMV</a></h4><button class="banner-close" aria-label="Close notice: SCAM ALERT: Multiple fraudulent texts and calls claiming unpaid tolls, tickets, or other infractions &#8211; NOT FROM UDOT OR DMV">Close</button></div><div class="banner-body"><p>We&#8217;ve been made aware that some Utahns are receiving a text message asking for personal information and money for a toll service. <strong>Do not respond or give any information.</strong> This is part of a nation-wide scam. UDOT&#8217;s databases have not been compromised.  Some examples of scam texts are shown below.</p>
<p><strong>Report scams and suspicious communications to the <a href="https://reportfraud.ftc.gov/#/?orgcode=UTDOT" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Federal Trade Commission</a>.</strong></p>
<p>Additional Information:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="/2025/05/23/udot-warns-against-a-revamped-tolling-scam/">UDOT Press Release</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.ic3.gov/PSA/2024/PSA240412">FBI Scam Announcement</a></li>
</ul>
<div id="attachment_84810" style="width: 223px" class="wp-caption alignleft"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-84810" class="wp-image-84810" src="https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Scam-Text-May-2025-1-115x300.jpg" alt="" width="213" height="556" srcset="https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Scam-Text-May-2025-1-115x300.jpg 115w, https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Scam-Text-May-2025-1-392x1024.jpg 392w, https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Scam-Text-May-2025-1-768x2006.jpg 768w, https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Scam-Text-May-2025-1-588x1536.jpg 588w, https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Scam-Text-May-2025-1-784x2048.jpg 784w, https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Scam-Text-May-2025-1.jpg 873w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 213px) 100vw, 213px" /><p id="caption-attachment-84810" class="wp-caption-text">Example of May 2025 Scam Text</p></div>
<div id="attachment_83022" style="width: 211px" class="wp-caption alignleft"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-83022" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-83022" src="https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/screenshot-2025-04-01-at-9-44-06a_am-1-201x300.jpeg" alt="" width="201" height="300" srcset="https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/screenshot-2025-04-01-at-9-44-06a_am-1-201x300.jpeg 201w, https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/screenshot-2025-04-01-at-9-44-06a_am-1-685x1024.jpeg 685w, https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/screenshot-2025-04-01-at-9-44-06a_am-1-768x1147.jpeg 768w, https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/screenshot-2025-04-01-at-9-44-06a_am-1.jpeg 893w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 201px) 100vw, 201px" /><p id="caption-attachment-83022" class="wp-caption-text">Example of scam text</p></div>
<div id="attachment_80594" style="width: 245px" class="wp-caption alignleft"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-80594" class="wp-image-80594 size-medium" src="https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/FastTrak-Scam-Text-1-235x300.png" alt="FastTrak Lane tolls Scam Text" width="235" height="300" srcset="https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/FastTrak-Scam-Text-1-235x300.png 235w, https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/FastTrak-Scam-Text-1-802x1024.png 802w, https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/FastTrak-Scam-Text-1-768x980.png 768w, https://connect.udot.utah.gov/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/FastTrak-Scam-Text-1.png 865w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 235px) 100vw, 235px" /><p id="caption-attachment-80594" class="wp-caption-text">Example of scam text</p></div>
